      "title": "LPN I - Student Health Center - 9 month - 531092",
      "description": "LPN I - Student Health Center - 9 month - 531092 - Tuscaloosa, Alabama, United States My settings Featured Jobs Research Healthcare Information Technology (IT) Life at UA Campus Life Tuscaloosa Benefits Work Life Search Jobs Job Alerts Staff Jobs Student Jobs Faculty Jobs UA System Jobs My Application Kiosk mode LPN I - Student Health Center - 9 month - 531092 Tuscaloosa, Alabama, United States Apply Now Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search LPN I - Student Health Center - 9 month - 531092 Tuscaloosa, Alabama, United States Health Care / Social Services Other Closing at: Nov 16 2026 - 22:55 CST Pay Grade/Pay Range: Minimum: $19.52 - Midpoint: $24.38 (Hourly N5) Department/Organization: 201104 - SHC-Nursing Normal Work Schedule: Monday - Friday 8:00am to 5:00pm; occasional evening/weekend hours as needed Job Summary: The LPN facilitates quality patient care within the scope of licensure. Additional Department Summary: Follows all established clinical procedures and workflows for patient care and communication, privacy/security, and other regulatory requirements. Supports the enterprise services division of the college, including Health Informatics, Medical Billing, Medical Records and others to ensure patient billing and documentation are complete and accurate and follow all HIPPA and other regulatory requirements. Required Minimum Qualifications: Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) in the State of Alabama in good standing. Additional Required Department Minimum Qualifications: Final candidates must submit to and successfully pass a post-offer drug screen. Skills and Knowledge: Ability to perform patient care as directed by a physician, nurse practitioner or other qualified medical professional. Efficient and accurate computer and data entry skills. Excellent communication, public relations and customer service and telephone etiquette skills. Ability to multi-task in a fast-paced work environment. Desire to exemplify the co